/E (Once the emotion is identified, the system maps it to a curated YouTube search URL for Tamil songs matching that mood, such as joyful tracks for happiness or soothing melodies for sadness. The entire pipeline is implemented in Python using TensorFlow/Keras, OpenCV, and Scikit-learn. Class imbalance in the training dataset is addressed using computed class weights, and the model undergoes a two-phase training process: an initial frozen-base training phase followed by a fine-tuning phase where the last 30 layers of MobileNetV2 are unfrozen for domain adaptation. )
/Pg 11 0 R
