297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 113 0 R
/T (The proposed system is a complete end-to-end pipelinethat captures video from the user's webcam, detects faces, classifies the emotion, and maps it to appropriate music recommendations in real time. The architecture is modular: the face detection module operates independently of the emotion classification module, allowing either to be upgraded without modifying the other.  The system is built entirely in Python and relies on industry-standard libraries:  TensorFlow and Keras for deep learning, OpenCV for computer vision, and  Scikit-learn for evaluation metrics. The trained model is serialized to an HDF5  file named emotion_model.h5, enabling the detection pipeline to be deployed  independently from the training pipeline. )
/E (The proposed system is a complete end-to-end pipelinethat captures video from the user's webcam, detects faces, classifies the emotion, and maps it to appropriate music recommendations in real time. The architecture is modular: the face detection module operates independently of the emotion classification module, allowing either to be upgraded without modifying the other.  The system is built entirely in Python and relies on industry-standard libraries:  TensorFlow and Keras for deep learning, OpenCV for computer vision, and  Scikit-learn for evaluation metrics. The trained model is serialized to an HDF5  file named emotion_model.h5, enabling the detection pipeline to be deployed  independently from the training pipeline. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
