/T (The FER-2013 dataset contains 35,887 grayscale 48x48 pixel facial images distributed across seven emotion categories. The significant imbalance, particularly the disgust class with only 547 training samples versus happy with 8,989, necessitated the use of Scikit-learn's compute_class_weight function to calculate balanced class weights before training. )
/E (The FER-2013 dataset contains 35,887 grayscale 48x48 pixel facial images distributed across seven emotion categories. The significant imbalance, particularly the disgust class with only 547 training samples versus happy with 8,989, necessitated the use of Scikit-learn's compute_class_weight function to calculate balanced class weights before training. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
