464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 122 0 R
/T ( Development of a mobile application version using TensorFlow Lite for real-time emotion detection directly on smartphones without requiring a laptop or webcam.  Incorporation of speech emotion recognition as a secondary modality,  fusing audio-based affect signals with visual cues for more robust  emotion estimation in challenging lighting conditions.  Extension of the music catalog to include regional Indian languages beyond Tamil, including Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, and Hindi, to serve a broader demographic.  Implementation of a feedback loop where user skip or replay behavior  in the recommended playlist is used to fine-tune the emotion-to-music  mapping over time through reinforcement learning.  Application of attention mechanisms and Vision Transformers to replace MobileNetV2 for potentially higher accuracy, particularly on the challenging fearand sad emotion classes. )
/E ( Development of a mobile application version using TensorFlow Lite for real-time emotion detection directly on smartphones without requiring a laptop or webcam.  Incorporation of speech emotion recognition as a secondary modality,  fusing audio-based affect signals with visual cues for more robust  emotion estimation in challenging lighting conditions.  Extension of the music catalog to include regional Indian languages beyond Tamil, including Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, and Hindi, to serve a broader demographic.  Implementation of a feedback loop where user skip or replay behavior  in the recommended playlist is used to fine-tune the emotion-to-music  mapping over time through reinforcement learning.  Application of attention mechanisms and Vision Transformers to replace MobileNetV2 for potentially higher accuracy, particularly on the challenging fearand sad emotion classes. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
