904 0 obj
<<
/Title (The emotion detection module \(detect.py\)loads the serialized model from emotion_model.h5 and initializes OpenCV'sHaar Cascade face detector. Each frame captured from the webcam is converted to grayscale for face detection. Detected face bounding boxes are used to crop the corresponding RGB region, which is then resized to 96x96, normalized, and expanded to a batch dimension before being passed to the model.  The model outputs a probability vector of length 7. The argmax of this vector  determines the predicted emotion class. The emotion label and bounding box)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 897 0 R
/Next 905 0 R
>>
endobj
905 0 obj
<<
/Title (are overlaid on the live video frame using cv2.putText\(\) and cv2.rectangle\(\), providing immediate visual feedback to the user.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 897 0 R
/Prev 904 0 R
>>
