/Title (Training proceeds in two phases. In Phase 1, the MobileNetV2 base is frozen and only the custom head is trained for 25 epochs with an Adam optimizer at learning rate 0.001. In Phase 2 \(fine-tuning\), the last 30 layers of the base are unfrozen and the entire network is trained for 15 additional epochs at a reduced learning rate of 0.00001 to prevent catastrophic forgetting of ImageNet features.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 903 0 R
>>
