/Title (The model was evaluated using an 80/20 train-test split consistent with the original FER-2013 benchmark split. Metrics computed include per-class precision, recall, and F1-score, as well as a macro-averaged F1-score across all seven classes. A confusion matrix was also generated to visualize inter- class misclassification patterns, particularly between neutral and sad, and between fear and surprise,which are pairs known to be perceptually similar.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
