<<
/Title (CVPR. This paper introduces the MobileNetV2 architecture, highlighting its computational efficiency for mobile and embedded applications. The inverted residual structure with linear bottlenecks reduces memory footprint while maintaining accuracy, making it ideal for real-time inference on consumer- grade hardware.  Zhang, K., et al. \(2022\) 'Facial Expression Recognition Using Deep Learning',  IEEE Transactions on Affective Computing, Vol.13, No.2, pp.945-958. This  study presents a comprehensive study on using CNNs for facial action unit  detection. The paper demonstrates that transfer learning from large ImageNet- pretrained models significantly improves recognition accuracy on small  emotion datasets. A limitation noted is that performance degrades under  varying illumination conditions.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 926 0 R
/Next 932 0 R
>>
